<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 12:16:59 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>人工智能的三体问题：没有任何单一力量可以决定结果</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/ais-three-body-problem-no-single-force-can-dictate-the-outcome/</link><description>OpenAI和Anthropic是一个整体，中国的开放权重模型是另一个主体，然后还有建立在两者之上的应用公司。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gupta.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/ais-three-body-problem-no-single-force-can-dictate-the-outcome/</guid></item><item><title>美国面临价值 1720 亿美元的儿童保育问题。投资者忽视了部分解决方案</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/america-172-billion-child-care-problem-real-estate/</link><description>美国多年来一直在争论儿童保育费用，而数百万家庭仍在争夺有限的席位。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AD0A1403.webp?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 11:15:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/america-172-billion-child-care-problem-real-estate/</guid></item><item><title>这位 CEO 出去吃晚饭时发现他的 AI 代理浪费了 1,000 美元的代币。他说“不安全感”是一个更大的问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/tokenmaxxing-ceo-dinner-1000-dollars-insecurity-maxio-jenkins/</link><description>Maxio 首席执行官布兰登·詹金斯 (Branden Jenkins) 向《财富》杂志表示：“我想说，一千并不算多，但对于一个周末来说，这已经相当烦人了。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bj.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/tokenmaxxing-ceo-dinner-1000-dollars-insecurity-maxio-jenkins/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能的繁荣正在提振整个亚洲的经济。但对于东南亚来说，这可能只是“短期现象”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/asia-ai-boom-southeast-asia-economic-geopolitical-divide-short-term-blip/</link><description>研究该地区的经济学家担心人工智能的收益不会在整个亚洲平均分配。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2182348720.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/asia-ai-boom-southeast-asia-economic-geopolitical-divide-short-term-blip/</guid></item><item><title>退役赛车手吉米·约翰逊 (Jimmie Johnson) 将自己数百万美元的成功归功于擦鞋和提前 10 分钟到达：“小事很重要”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/nascar-hall-of-fame-racer-jimmie-johnson-secrets-success-small-things-matter-gen-z-advice/</link><description>七届 NASCAR 冠军吉米·约翰逊向《财富》杂志讲述了小习惯、父母的支持以及工作与生活的平衡如何塑造了他的职业生涯。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2261660771-e1787336603389.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/nascar-hall-of-fame-racer-jimmie-johnson-secrets-success-small-things-matter-gen-z-advice/</guid></item><item><title>财富500强老牌CEO将一家80年历史的AC公司变成了AI宠儿</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/dave-cote-vertiv-stock-performance-ai-boom/</link><description>首先，戴夫·科特改变了霍尼韦尔。退休后，他对一家鲜为人知的公司维谛技术 (Vertiv) 下了惊人的赌注。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-539925046-e1787325522986.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/dave-cote-vertiv-stock-performance-ai-boom/</guid></item><item><title>在地下 60 年之后为云提供动力：Ormat 的地热转向人工智能</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/after-60-years-underground-power-cloud-ormat-ai-pivot/</link><description>Ormat 与 Sage Geosystems 和 SLB 在内华达州启动了两个下一代地热项目。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Edited_Doron-e1787337441808.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 07:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/after-60-years-underground-power-cloud-ormat-ai-pivot/</guid></item><item><title>独家：亚马逊一夜之间悄悄提高了 Echo、Fire TV、Kindle 和 eero 的价格，以抵消内存成本的“大幅上涨”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/exclusive-amazon-quietly-hiked-prices-echo-fire-tv-kindle-eero-significant-increases-memory-costs/</link><description>苹果、戴尔和微软 Xbox 也采取了类似举措，这家电子商务公司的硬件价格也随之上涨。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2201505685-e1787356134569.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:50:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/exclusive-amazon-quietly-hiked-prices-echo-fire-tv-kindle-eero-significant-increases-memory-costs/</guid></item><item><title>亚历克斯·琼斯 (Alex Jones) 不再为桑迪·胡克 (Sandy Hook) 家族所欠 5000 万美元的债务所困扰，但他仍有 12.5 亿美元的债务悬而未决</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/alex-jones-50-million-sandy-hook-families-1-25-billion/</link><description>Infowars 的创始人只能被迫从德克萨斯州法院支付约 600 万美元，但康涅狄格州仍有高达 12.5 亿美元的单独判决。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1425979492-e1787347907602.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:36:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/alex-jones-50-million-sandy-hook-families-1-25-billion/</guid></item><item><title>共和党人表示让他们吃价格过高的汉堡，指责特朗普“用外国牛肉充斥市场”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/republicans-donald-trump-beef-import-announcement-consumers-expense/</link><description>美国养牛者协会主席贾斯汀·塔珀（Justin Tupper）表示：“把美国养牛生产者放在最后并不能把美国放在第一位。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290507653-e1787347370864.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:27:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/republicans-donald-trump-beef-import-announcement-consumers-expense/</guid></item></channel></rss>